{"version":1,"content":"<p>剛果民主共和國（簡稱剛果（金））正在經歷該國歷史上最嚴重的一次伊波拉疫情。截至2026年11月11日，剛果（金）衞生部門公佈的最新數據顯示，累計感染人數已經達到11042人，其中5387人死亡，死亡人數接近感染總人數的一半。這場疫情自今年5月中旬正式宣佈暴發以來，持續快速擴散，已經波及全國26個省份中的8個。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585952.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T12:17:48.562265+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:56:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T12:11:09.858834+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T12:11:09.858834+00:00","content_hash":"7af16505794a9cdeecdad3e46547462258265fd6a9f6ddf7a644d9047fea5d0f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}